OL,3,AEvacuations after restaurant crash
OL,4,Acauses gas leak
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car has crashed into a restaurant in
OL,7,FLiverpool city centre causing road
OL,8,Fclosures due to a gas leak.
OL,10,FThe incident happened at about 12:30
OL,11,FGMT on North John Street when a Peugeot
OL,12,Fcar hit the window of Tiger Rock
OL,13,FRestaurant, Merseyside Police said.
OL,15,FThe driver stayed at the scene and
OL,16,Fthere is no indication that this was a
OL,17,Fdeliberate act, the force said.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
